Change 'Advisers publish future non-overlapping slots. Students book slots; either side can cancel eligible bookings. Transactions prevent double booking.' 'Future slots are checked for overlap before creation; this check is not atomic. Booking one slot is transactional. Members or the owner can cancel before its start; booked slots cannot be deleted.'
